            "scope": "children",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Part I The following subjects which fall within List I of the Soventh Schedule to the Constitution of India: Nil Part II The following subject which falls within List III of the Seventh Schedule to the Constitution of India (as regards legislation only):"
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "1",
                "text": "Social Security and Social Insurance."
              },
              {
                "type": "part",
                "num": "III",
                "heading": "PART III",
                "text": "For the Union territories, the following subjects which fall within List II or List III of the Seventh Schedule to the Constitution of India, in so far as they exist in regard to such territories:-"
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "2",
                "text": "Relief of the disabled and unemployable and measures relating to social security and social insurance, save to the extent allotted to any other Department."
              },
              {
                "type": "part",
                "num": "IV",
                "heading": "PART IV",
                "text": "General and Consequential:-"
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "3",
                "text": "Social welfare; social welfare planning, project formulation. research. evaluation statistics and training."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "4",
                "text": "Family Welfare."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "5",
                "text": "Woman and child welfare and co-ordination of activities of other Ministries and Organisations in connection with this subject."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "6",
                "text": "Care of pre-school children."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "7",
                "text": "Nutrition feeding of pre-school children and nutrition education of women."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "8",
                "text": "Institutional and non-institutional services for the care and development of children in need including orphans, and orphanages."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "9",
                "text": "United Nations International Children's Emergency Fund (UNICEF)."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "10",
                "text": "Education, training, rehabilitation and welfare of the physically and mentall handicapped."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "11",
                "text": "National Institute for physically Handicapped and Mentally Retarded."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "12",
                "text": "National Centre for the blind, including the Central Braille Press, Dehra Dun: Training Centre for the Adult Deaf, and school for partially deaf children, Hyderabad Model School for Mentally Retarded Children, New Delhi and other national institutes."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "13",
                "text": "Central Social Welfare Board."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "14",
                "text": "Social and Moral Hygiene programmes."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "15",
                "text": "Beggary; Juvenile vagrancy, delinquency and other care programmes"
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "16",
                "text": "Probation of Juvenile offenders."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "17",
                "text": "Research, evaluation, training, exchange of information and technical guidance on all social defence matters, including correctional services."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "18",
                "text": "All matters relating to prohibition."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "19",
                "text": "Education and social welfare aspects of drug addiction."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "20",
                "text": "Charitable and religious endowments pertaining to subjects allocated to this Department."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "21",
                "text": "Promotion and development of voluntary effort on subjects allocated to the Department."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "22",
                "text": "Central Institute of Research and Training in public Cooperation."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "23",
                "text": "Central Bureau of Correctional Services."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "24",
                "text": "Social Welfare and Rehabilitation Directorate."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "25",
                "text": "All other attached or subordinate offices or other organisations concerned with any of the subjects specified in the list."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "26",
                "text": "Administration of the following Acts:—"
              },
              {
                "type": "item",
                "num": "a",
                "text": "Suppression of Immoral Traffic Act, 1956"
              },
              {
                "type": "item",
                "num": "b",
                "text": "Probation of Offenders Act, 1958; and"
              },
              {
                "type": "item",
                "num": "c",
                "text": "Children Act, 1960."
              }
            ],
